{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22993","headline":"闻杨十二新拜省郎遥以诗贺 · 白居易","name":"闻杨十二新拜省郎遥以诗贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文昌新入有光辉，紫界宫墙白粉闱。\n晓日鸡人传漏箭，春风侍女护朝衣。\n雪飘歌句高难和，鹤拂烟霄老惯飞。\n官职声名俱入手，近来诗客似君稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}